+
+**English Translation:**
+My studio...
+is full of winter moonlight...
+I have a fever... love rains warm in my memory...
+I do not know what secret the cloud,
+I do not know what secret the water,
+I do not know what secret the moonlight holds...
+The more in love you are...
+the sadder the cloud...
+the bluer the water...
+the moonlight... the more moonlit...
+1370/9/27
