+که با چشم خود ببینم.
+از هر مژه به ساحلِ دیدن راهی‌ست...
+چه مرزِ حساسی...
+باریک و تاریک...
+با کفش‌های شوق،
+از «مسیر نبضِ عناصر»*
+عبور کن...
+در معبری چنین...
+باید چراغ رنگ به دست بگیریم
+و در تاریک‌ترین لحظه
+با نگاهی تَر
+و ذکر «دوستت دارم»
+به دنبال پیری بگردیم...
+و از او چیزی بپرسیم...
+
+**English Translation:**
+My love... look again —
+looking is not seeing...
+From cloud to rain...
+is one brushstroke's distance...
+one breath bluer...
+and the moonlight goes out.
+A lifetime passed... before
+I saw with my own eyes...
+how hard it is
+to see with my own eyes.
+From every eyelash to the shore of seeing there is a road...
+what a delicate border...
+narrow, and dark...
+With the shoes of longing,
+pass through
+"the path of the pulse of the elements"*...
+On a crossing like this...
+we must take up the lamp of color
+and in the darkest moment,
+with a wet gaze
+and the invocation "I love you,"
+go looking for some old man...
+and ask him something...
+
